> <br /> ....Did you actually stop posting pictures you like? You *can* selectively block what people see on your FB timeline. And I fell asleep last night just after sending some funny Kuroko no Basuke yaoi to a friend over FB, so I can't laugh at you without laughing at myself. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>\u201cNobody is purely good or purely evil. Mo</b></span><b>st of us are in-between. There are moths that explore the day and butterflies that play at night.\u201d </b><br /> - Suzy Kassem, Rise Up and Salute The Sun<br /> <b>(She/Her)</b></span></span>","edited":{"userid":380,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","user":"AzraelFirestorm","date":". 08-02-2014, 09:03 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","name":"AzraelFirestorm","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar380_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-02T06:54:35-07:00","id":216732,"title":"","content":"It's mostly because I can't quite predict the result if I ever come out, she definitely not gonna go all &quot;You're not my SON&quot; on me, but she's not gonna just say &quot;You're gay, so what ?&quot; either.<br /> <br /> Turn out &quot;The Talk&quot; only last like 10 minutes I think, it contain almost every cliche anti-gay words and phrase you can think of: unnatural, implying being gay is a choice, say that I'm not a man anymore or how I secretly want to be a girl.<br /> <br /> Thank god all those lurking on gay forum finally pay off since I can counter everything she can throw at me (yeah, I know it's not suppose to be an argument but I can't help it)<br /> <br /> Hilariously, she started talking to me about the facebook thing when I was busy creating a <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/216662-some-very-important-question-regarding-volfer-san-nsfw-maybe\">thread </a>to express my.....eh.....&quot;academic&quot; interested in the new Signature character in Exalted Third Edition. This must be some kind of sign, Volfer-san, I will never leave you !","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The no.1 fan of Demetheus. I also draw <a href=\"https://probably-unreliable.tumblr.com/tagged/Jenart\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted</a> things and is looking for commission works ~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/298-jen","name":"Jen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar298_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-02T07:24:11-07:00","id":216744,"title":"","content":"I'm glad you finally had the opportunity to talk openly, but I'm sorry you had to have her spew hurtful words and baseless assumptions at you to do it. I myself, being comprised mostly of marshmallows, weakness and a hoodie, would've quailed in the presence of any mother-based homophobia. It's nice to know that you employed Perfect Defense and swatted that bullshit like ignorance-bugs. I'm so proud of you I could hug you. Granted, I do have the odd tendency to add a cat-like nuzzling to my hugs, but I try to hold it back to respect boundaries. (If you nuzzle first, though, it's officially Nuzzling Cuddle-Time. Just fyi.)<br /> <br /> Dammit, why can't we just hang out in a virtual world so I can hug my fellow forumites when it feels appropriate??!? Fine. I'll celebrate my LGBT pride another way:<br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://www.troll.me/images/glamorous-grayson/taste-the-rainbow-bitch-i-live-the-rainbow.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>\u201cNobody is purely good or purely evil. Mo</b></span><b>st of us are in-between. There are moths that explore the day and butterflies that play at night.\u201d </b><br /> - Suzy Kassem, Rise Up and Salute The Sun<br /> <b>(She/Her)</b></span></span>","edited":{"userid":380,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","user":"AzraelFirestorm","date":". 08-02-2014, 10:32 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","name":"AzraelFirestorm","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar380_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-02T07:31:08-07:00","id":216749,"title":"","content":"My father and mother are under the impresssion my best friends and I are all gay. They've never alluded to it in conversation but whenever I tell them I'm heading out its always with Friend A or B and its typically dinner and a movie (because thats what we can afford and we can only catch up ever once in a while). I think its hilarious. I'm waiting for my dad to pull me aside and just ask one night when hes drunk","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>pls respont","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/372-cerealkiller","name":"cerealkiller","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar372_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-02T08:43:49-07:00","id":216766,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AzraelFirestorm</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/58142-the-lgbt-thread?p=216744#post216744\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm glad you finally had the opportunity to talk openly, but I'm sorry you had to have her spew hurtful words and baseless assumptions at you to do it. I myself, being comprised mostly of marshmallows, weakness and a hoodie, would've quailed in the presence of any mother-based homophobia. It's nice to know that you employed Perfect Defense and swatted that bullshit like ignorance-bugs. I'm so proud of you I could hug you. Granted, I do have the odd tendency to add a cat-like nuzzling to my hugs, but I try to hold it back to respect boundaries. (If you nuzzle first, though, it's officially Nuzzling Cuddle-Time. Just fyi).</div> </div> </div> </div>Thank you for your kind word :'&gt;<br /> <br /> It's actually not that hurtful, since the word &quot;unnatural&quot; in my language don't have the same level of sting as the English one. Though I did feel annoy when she said the word &quot;B\u00ea \u0110\u00ea&quot;, I think it's can be equal to the word fag, but since that how pretty much everybody here refer to gay I just have to let it slide.<br /> <br /> Overall, it's actually went pretty smoothly, I did feel kinda weird inside atm, I suppose I just have to wait and see how this will all turn out.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>cerealkiller</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/58142-the-lgbt-thread?p=216749#post216749\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">My father and mother are under the impresssion my best friends and I are all gay. They've never alluded to it in conversation but whenever I tell them I'm heading out its always with Friend A or B and its typically dinner and a movie (because thats what we can afford and we can only catch up ever once in a while). I think its hilarious. I'm waiting for my dad to pull me aside and just ask one night when hes drunk</div> </div> </div> </div>I kinda want it to be my mom asking me &quot;Are you gay ?&quot; too. But not many people in South East Asian know about what gay is, most just assume it's mean the &quot;Snap, take it gurrll&quot; drag queen type or transgender (my country sit next to Thailand which is infamous for gender surgery and cross-dressing).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The no.1 fan of Demetheus. I also draw <a href=\"https://probably-unreliable.tumblr.com/tagged/Jenart\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted</a> things and is looking for commission works ~","edited":{"userid":298,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/298-jen","user":"Jen","date":". 08-02-2014, 11:56 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/298-jen","name":"Jen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar298_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-02T15:58:43-07:00","id":217018,"title":"","content":"I'm sorry, Jen, that your accidental coming out didn't go as well as it could have.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;For these reasons, the trade of a soldier is held the most honourable of all others; because a soldier is a Yahoo hired to kill, in cold blood, as many of his own species, who have never offended him, as possibly he can.&quot; \u2015 from &quot;Gulliver's Travels&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1041-brjedi26","name":"brjedi26","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1041_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"495"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-02T20:26:13-07:00","id":217135,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jen</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/58142-the-lgbt-thread?p=216766#post216766\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Thank you for your kind word :'&gt;<br /> <br /> It's actually not that hurtful, since the word &quot;unnatural&quot; in my language don't have the same level of sting as the English one. Though I did feel annoy when she said the word &quot;B\u00ea \u0110\u00ea&quot;, I think it's can be equal to the word fag, but since that how pretty much everybody here refer to gay I just have to let it slide.<br /> <br /> Overall, it's actually went pretty smoothly, I did feel kinda weird inside atm, I suppose I just have to wait and see how this will all turn out.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> I kinda want it to be my mom asking me &quot;Are you gay ?&quot; too. But not many people in South East Asian know about what gay is, most just assume it's mean the &quot;Snap, take it gurrll&quot; drag queen type or transgender (my country sit next to Thailand which is infamous for gender surgery and cross-dressing).</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I think its hilarious. it makes my two best friends somewhat uncomfortable but my family treats tehm like family as well so I gess thats a good thing. I'm not, for the record, attracted to either of them but they do stay at my place once in a while and my best friend we get into spats sometimes over stupid shit (my mom calls them 'lovers qurrells&quot; as a joke) My dad has never said anything. I'm not gay but I just find the whole thing entertaining and thought some of you might find it so as welll.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>pls respont","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/372-cerealkiller","name":"cerealkiller","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar372_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-03T08:13:14-07:00","id":217411,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5XJM2eFxAgg&amp;list=UU0mjkSKz9oMZJJmzNbXAwWA\" data-code=\"5XJM2eFxAgg\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/5XJM2eFxAgg/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /> <br /> Just for a laugh or two, on language and homophobia.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/316-jesuncolo","name":"Jesuncolo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar316_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"493"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-07T02:29:39-07:00","id":220881,"title":"","content":"This Monday morning my mother and my boyfriend will be meeting eachother at breakfast. My sister was pressuring me to introduce him to her because he wants me to bring someone home, and because my mother needs sunglasses for sunshine-related problems (which he sells in his shop).<br /> My mother told my sister that &quot;if that makes him happy, be it&quot; and &quot;can we invite him for dinner sometimes?&quot;.<br /> I'm not worried, but I am nervous. We never talk about sex and my sexual orientation, because talking with my mother about sex is awkward, especially for her. And given that my mother trusts me for about everything, I never tell her anything unless asked, usually. Especially when talking about my tastes. I've a better connection with my sister, she's the one I can talk to, about anything. If I really need to, of course. It's not like I find the necessity to tell anyone of anything.<br /> We'll see how it goes, probably I'm more nervous than what the situation will need.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/316-jesuncolo","name":"Jesuncolo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar316_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"493"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-07T04:36:46-07:00","id":220923,"title":"","content":"Seems like what you have is the regular panic before you introduce your special someone to your parents <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />. That's completly reasonable even without added complications, but It seems you are good. Your family seems quite open.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i><b>I</b>'m <b>S</b>o <b>M</b>eta <b>E</b>ven <b>T</b>his <b>A</b>cronym</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/195-thorbes","name":"Thorbes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar195_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2982"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-07T05:03:00-07:00","id":220935,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>cerealkiller</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/58142-the-lgbt-thread?p=216749#post216749\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">My father and mother are under the impresssion my best friends and I are all gay. They've never alluded to it in conversation but whenever I tell them I'm heading out its always with Friend A or B and its typically dinner and a movie (because thats what we can afford and we can only catch up ever once in a while). I think its hilarious. I'm waiting for my dad to pull me aside and just ask one night when hes drunk</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Glad to hear I'm not the only one. I'm pretty sure my parents think I'm gay (I'm not), largely because I don't engage in stereotypical heterosexual male activities like skirt-chasing, and I feel secure enough to openly admire a handsome man (it's not sexual, just, well, pretty is pretty, regardless of it's a guy, a girl or a sunset). I <i>know</i> most people I know think I am, but then they're kind of stupid and think because I worked in a gay bar for a while that I must therefore be gay, particularly given my aforementioned lack of stereotypical heterosexual male traits.<br /> <br /> If I'm ever asked directly, I answer honestly (that's happened all of twice, I think), but I do avoid clarifying by implications, like talking about past girlfriends and the like, largely because it amuses me.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1mSW2-p-SwmYw5gaqnVMQ7HcRNhVedC-aA4vB6sBclGk/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My Commandments for GMs</a> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1hslzrmui6ML-v7LniQUXLNyy8o52YF9g2u6usdu-Drc/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My Commandments for Players</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/207-allan53","name":"Allan53","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"966"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-08T07:12:46-07:00","id":222097,"title":"","content":"I'm meeting up with new friend of female gender in a month in a sort of quasi date (surely it will look to outsiders as a date given our schedule), and basically my mother said: &quot;You are not gay, go for it&quot;. If she only knew, hahaha (cause I'm bi).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cI am absolute, I am perfect, I am supreme. I shall be eternal. My tragedy, is that there is no other fate for me. My powerlessness was that I couldn\u2019t subjugate my journey to the gods, while dreaming of rebirth at the end of distant time, like other pharaohs.\u201d Ramesses II, Fate/Prototype: Argent Fragments.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2918-kat","name":"Kat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2918_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1762"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-08T18:50:19-07:00","id":222671,"title":"","content":"I feel like I'm a sexually confused adolescent again. My heart is screaming at me to do something. Anything. I'm trying not to take things in my personal life so seriously, but it's not easy. <br /> <br /> I have some issues that complicate being bisexual.<br /> <br /> As a kid, I was molested and raped by my only friend at school. It went on for months. The stress from keeping it a secret gave me such intense stomach pain that I missed a month of school. As a survivor, I can look back and, intellectually, work out the issue that's stemming from it. On a purely emotional level, it feels crippling. I find it extremely hard to find men that I feel comfortable around in a social situation. <br /> <br /> I tend to be attracted to personality first (though being adorable, even if in an unconventional way, might help a bit), and that generally means I don't have a &quot;type&quot;. &quot;Interesting&quot; isn't a type. I fall for the mind and heart that make me feel <i>right</i>. Period. I want to have something worthwhile in my life.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>\u201cNobody is purely good or purely evil. Mo</b></span><b>st of us are in-between. There are moths that explore the day and butterflies that play at night.\u201d </b><br /> - Suzy Kassem, Rise Up and Salute The Sun<br /> <b>(She/Her)</b></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","name":"AzraelFirestorm","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar380_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-09T03:41:01-07:00","id":223090,"title":"","content":"I would argue that &quot;Interesting&quot; is indeed a type, and not a bad one as far as these things go. I don't have as much a type as a non-type, can't stand blondes for example. Curious note that &quot;blonde&quot; to me doesn't apply only to a certain hair color but a certain personality, so there's that.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i><b>I</b>'m <b>S</b>o <b>M</b>eta <b>E</b>ven <b>T</b>his <b>A</b>cronym</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/195-thorbes","name":"Thorbes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar195_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2982"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-09T06:36:12-07:00","id":223207,"title":"","content":"I finally got around to coming out to my mother a few weeks back.<br /> <br /> She just laughed and said she'd known for years - and by the way my older sister had once asked her if I was gay too.<br /> <br /> Then she said I should move to Copenhagen (the capital of my country) because &quot;there are more gay people over there&quot;.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Avatar by Raven &amp; Blue Jay.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/663-aleks","name":"Aleks","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar663_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"87"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-09T14:44:32-07:00","id":223615,"title":"","content":"Well, look at that, that's nice! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i><b>I</b>'m <b>S</b>o <b>M</b>eta <b>E</b>ven <b>T</b>his <b>A</b>cronym</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/195-thorbes","name":"Thorbes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar195_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2982"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-11T08:52:48-07:00","id":225108,"title":"","content":"The meeting went pretty well. They both had a good impression of each other. And my mother is already planning to tidy up home and take him here someday...Woah.<br /> This friday we're also going to a mountain location with all of my friends to have a happy pic-nic.<br /> <br /> I should probably make a reality check now.<br /> A year ago I couldn't even imagine to reach this far. I thought I'd never find anyone to make me happy, unless I started losing weight. Which I did anyways, but not as fast as I wanted. Or that I could take home someone so easily.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/316-jesuncolo","name":"Jesuncolo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar316_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,