out myself and having attention from this dude was a boost to my confidence ... and hearing that last night just left me feeling well and truly awful. I feel rejected by the guy, I feel betrayal by my roommate and best friend and I feel disappointed in myself for not being more attractive (I know, it's not something I can control, but I still feel shitty about it regardless). All my insecurities are bubbling to the surface and I spent the night telling myself why I don't deserve a guy like that. I figured I should get some sleep, because obviously I wasn't thinking straight. Woke up and I still feel like shit so this is more than just feeling tired/cranky.<br /> <br /> Dammit.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"right\"><span style=\"font-size:28px\"><b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">\u263e</span></span></b></span></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/438-wulf","name":"wulf","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar438_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"493"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-24T08:27:48-07:00","id":239160,"title":"","content":"I know that I'm new to this thread, but hey.<br /> <br /> I just wanted to give you a hug, man. I'm sorry.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;And for my next trick&quot; I said, &quot;anvils!&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2016-evilmarmelade","name":"Evilmarmelade","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2016_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"632"}]},"thankedby":