e a comforting hug mixed with kittens and supportive advice and sentiment <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>\u201cNobody is purely good or purely evil. Mo</b></span><b>st of us are in-between. There are moths that explore the day and butterflies that play at night.\u201d </b><br /> - Suzy Kassem, Rise Up and Salute The Sun<br /> <b>(She/Her)</b></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","name":"AzraelFirestorm","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar380_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-09T07:24:31-07:00","id":508905,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>InoshimaLance</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/58142-the-lgbt-thread?p=507769#post507769\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hello, nice to meet you all here. Gay guy new (And i mean it, really new) to the WoD and Onyx/White Wolf Universe. Hope I can make new friends and maybe start a nice RP here.</div> </div> </div> </div>Welcome! As others have posted, this is generally a pretty easy going forum/site (there's the occasional blow-up, now and again, but overall this is one of the least-drama-ridden forums on the net). WoD (in whatever incarnation) is a great system/setting, so I hope you have fun playing as well as enjoy posting here in the LGBT thread. (Per Wyrdhamster, above, as this is an LGBT thread, it *does* help to gender/orientation-identify, if only for relevancy to the thread and for pronoun-usage, where applicable. I'm a Bi/Gay-Male w/ Aromantic orientation. For whatever that's worth... <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> )<br /> <br /> EDIT: realized I should clarify -- I know you mentioned &quot;gay guy&quot;, but sometimes around here we get pretty specific about both sexual orientation, gender identity and romantic attraction (vs. strictly sexual); hence, the references.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I have been around here for waaaayyyy too fucking long...","edited":{"userid":1433,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1433-just-john-forever","user":"Just John, Forever...","date":". 05-09-2015, 10:29 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1433-just-john-forever","name":"Just John, Forever...","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-09T23:50:05-07:00","id":509656,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>InoshimaLance</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/58142-the-lgbt-thread?p=507769#post507769\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hello, nice to meet you all here. Gay guy new (And i mean it, really new) to the WoD and Onyx/White Wolf Universe. Hope I can make new friends and maybe start a nice RP here.</div> </div> </div> </div>Hey dude! What's up? Welcome to the thread. I'm Cecoyotl and I am a bisexual male. As everyone has said this is a very friendly thread to express yourself. So don't be shy to talk or socialize with everyone. We have awesome people here. And yeah, welcome!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2360-cecoyotl","name":"Cecoyotl","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2360_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"207"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-10T04:16:27-07:00","id":509777,"title":"","content":"Hey guys... gay male... &quot;bear&quot;... kinda... geek...<br /> <br /> <br /> Little about me... Finally came out shortly out of high school. A few years later I met my first beau and the two of us would end up spending the next 10 years together. We never did get married, for a couple reasons...<br /> <br /> [Griping and Whining]<br /> <br /> 1) I didn't feel like the time was right in my life. This doesn't speak very highly of me but I have been spending all those years kind of coasting through life, never really chasing my ambitions. I have been working a crummy job that pays like crap because it's easy. I want to turn my life around in that respect.<br /> <br /> 2) We were monogamous at my insistence. Eventually he got to cybering behind my back, and I found out, which was a pretty devastating blow. I tried for many years to get over it, but I never did. He seemed to take the position that what I didn't know couldn't hurt me. What he never seemed to understand is that sometimes... we just know things about the people we love. Even if I didn't have proof, I could sense it.<br /> <br /> After the breakup he hit the ground running. He is already shacked up with a new guy in the polyamourus relationship of his dreams in another state, while I have spent the last year depressed and trying to figure out what I did wrong in the last relationship, and feeling pretty lonely, since he was my best friend as well.<br /> <br /> [/Griping and Whining]<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1078-froggy711","name":"Froggy711","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1078_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"314"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-10T12:21:45-07:00","id":510096,"title":"","content":"Why am I attracted to foreign guys?<br /> <br /> I've been hanging on dating apps like planetromeo or okcupid those last months, and I came to a conclusion : with very few exceptions, the only guys I find attractive are not french. Most of them are on the other side of the Atlantic, although I did find a few italians and spanish men. <br /> It's getting kinda annoying. I'm starting to think that this map is actually accurate : <a href=\"http://farm5.static.flickr.com/4148/5009856543_a91e9c5445_o.jpg\" target=\"_blank\">http://farm5.static.flickr.com/4148/...1e9c5445_o.jpg</a> It is fucking Twinkreich in here!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;And for my next trick&quot; I said, &quot;anvils!&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2016-evilmarmelade","name":"Evilmarmelade","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2016_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"J