> &quot;Ugh, so many people think that just when you're monogamous with a person of one sex or gender, CLEARLY you're really just attracted to that ONE sex or gender.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Wait, that's how it works? Shit, better tell my fiance that we can't admire pretty ladies together anymore because apparently she's straight!&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-06T04:22:07-08:00","id":781069,"title":"","content":"Heh, then it was me misunderstanding because tired... sleep dep, the excuse to all your ills, though not a cure! Insomnia is a nasty thing. Amusingly, I'm doing this while I'm watching an anime that has a pretty good example of a bi girl.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr />\u200bWhen noise turns to silence, when colors dull and pale, when reality no longer makes sense, there shall you find me. There, in the dreams of the River of Faceless Millions, do I dwell.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://harenm.deviantart.com/gallery/\" target=\"_blank\">http://harenm.deviantart.com/gallery/</a> for my art.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/378-haren","name":"haren","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar378_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"664"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-06T06:26:28-08:00","id":781103,"title":"","content":"Hhhhhuh. I was aware of that thread earlier this week, but I quit reading it because my lack of passion for Exalted these days depresses me. Following the links back to it, there are definitely a lot of sentiments there I did not expect to read in almost-2016. I mean, I thought we as a culture agreed to move back to hating black people and women...which I originally wrote as a joke but is actually a lot more true than I want it to be. Shit.<br /> <br /> Okay, let's bring this post back on topic:<br /> <br /> To my brothers and sisters of whatever sexual orientation and/or gender identification, much love and much support. I'm sorry you have to put up with people who think they have some business trying to regulate your innermost feelings, but if it helps at all, here are some words from the always awesome Ian McKellan:<br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://49.media.tumblr.com/ddd0939baec32aecddc4da736b09fd10/tumblr_nwjrcvA8gF1qzpabso2_500.gif\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://45.media.tumblr.com/7d1dd4cccfd32be2060239efc51ae6ac/tumblr_nwjrcvA8gF1qzpabso3_500.gif\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://45.media.tumblr.com/3c2a2fba8e90739161a496f6c35e9901/tumblr_nwjrcvA8gF1qzpabso5_500.gif\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://45.media.tumblr.com/ca1c1a06bbafbd605a0db6f1e125376b/tumblr_nwjrcvA8gF1qzpabso1_500.gif\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-06T07:14:55-08:00","id":781121,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JayTee</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/58142-the-lgbt-thread?p=781011#post781011\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Apparently before I was given a chance to defend my position the thread was locked with the snide insinuation that I was defending bigoted statements, and told to go post in this thread.<br /> <br /> Sure. Why not.<br /> <br /> Here is the post I had compiled before the threadlock:</div> </div> </div> </div><span style=\"color:red\">The thread was locked along with explicit red text instructions not to continue discussion of the ban. As you reference Baroness Nerak's post here, I can only assume you have read it, and simply chosen to ignore the part where she said not to continue discussing the ban. I'm giving you a day off, and when you come back, don't bring the ban up again.</span><br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>haren</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/58142-the-lgbt-thread?p=781045#post781045\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">On a completely separate topic, were you ever into Exalted? I knew someone seemingly FOREVER ago who was and went by that nickname.</div> </div> </div> </div>Huh. I've never actually played Exalted. Though I knew someone who went by the same username (slightly different spelling) who played Magic: the Gathering.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":269,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","user":"Charlaquin","date":". 12-06-2015, 10:43 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-06T08:03:34-08:00","id":781141,"title":"","content":"Huh, interesting. Person I knew actually made a fan supplement WAY BACK in the day. Ah, here... from a game wiki, a description of his game to test play it...<ul><li><a href=\"http://wiki.stryck.com/SolInvictus/SolInvictus\" target=\"_blank\">Sol Invictus</a> - the high-powered Solar Game run by Charlequin.</li> </ul>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr />\u200bWhen noise turns to silence, when colors dull and pale, when reality no longer makes sense, there shall you find me. There, in the dreams of the River of Faceless Millions, do I dwell.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://harenm.deviantart.com/gallery/\" target=\"_blank\">http://harenm.deviantart.com/gallery/</a> for my art.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/378-haren","name":"haren","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar378_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"664"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-06T08:33:01-08:00","id":781148,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>haren</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/58142-the-lgbt-thread?p=781141#post781141\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Huh, interesting. Person I knew actually made a fan supplement WAY BACK in the day. Ah, here... from a game wiki, a description of his game to test play it...<ul><li><a href=\"http://&quot;&#91;url\" target=\"_blank\">http://wiki.stryck.com/SolInvictus/SolInvictus&quot;]Sol</a> Invictus[/URL] - the high-powered Solar Game run by Charlequin.</li> </ul></div> </div> </div> </div>Well, what do you know. That's definitely not me, but it is pretty cool! I think a little ways back on this same thread someone said my username sounded familiar and asked if it was from something. I wonder if they might have been thinking of this Charlequin?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-06T11:18:28-08:00","id":781218,"title":"","content":"So. That Exalted thread. Honestly I had to pretty much leave the forums for the duration of it, because every time I opened it I wanted to just vomit out long, rant-filled bitter diatribes against some of the the things that were said. Since everyone else was doing so in a more articulate and cooler headed manner than I felt I was capable of doing, I refrained and instead did housework and played some fallout. If you haven't played, Dogmeat is (as always) nourishment for the soul in trying times.<br /> <br /> I don't have much else to say about the thread right now. I want to thank the community for making the points I would have tried to make and thank the mods for being professional and handling it when it needed to be handled. Thanks","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9258-col","name":"CoL","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9258_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"278"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-06T12:35:07-08:00","id":781252,"title":"","content":"For all I know, that might have been me, but I think I've mostly seen you over in the Changeling: the Lost forum before when I have.<br /> <br /> For CoL, I played Neko Atsume... cute kitties I take pictures of are fun.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr />\u200bWhen noise turns to silence, when colors dull and pale, when reality no longer makes sense, there shall you find me. There, in the dreams of the River of Faceless Millions, do I dwell.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://harenm.deviantart.com/gallery/\" target=\"_blank\">http://harenm.deviantart.com/gallery/</a> for my art.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://foru