ng quite like that, but trust me, if nothing else I get the atmosphere of... I dunno loathing? I've seen it where I live and in some people I'm related to (not any of the ones I care about but that's another story). So I'm sorry you feel the need to go through that there. I hope it is ok for you.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr />\u200bWhen noise turns to silence, when colors dull and pale, when reality no longer makes sense, there shall you find me. There, in the dreams of the River of Faceless Millions, do I dwell.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://harenm.deviantart.com/gallery/\" target=\"_blank\">http://harenm.deviantart.com/gallery/</a> for my art.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/378-haren","name":"haren","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar378_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"664"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-10T15:26:22-08:00","id":783705,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dragonmystic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/58142-the-lgbt-thread?p=783616#post783616\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I have to get off my chest my frustrations and rant a bit, I hope that's okay.<br /> <br /> I am not looking forward to going to my parent's place for Christmas. I never should have let them guilt me into going back. I mean, I like some of my family, but even then the sheer religious culture of the place I grew up in is oppressive without any intentional malice, due to the doctrine on LGBT people. I don't think even the nice members of my family realize why I get uneasy when all they talk about is &quot;church activity this&quot; and &quot;church activity that.&quot; I don't like being reminded that my family believes in a religion that thinks I am somehow so flawed and...not worthy enough to be respected and treated like a person. Anytime I bring it up, they just get defensive and upset that I am &quot;attacking their religious beliefs.&quot;<br /> <br /> And then there's my dad. He....well. I told him I was gay. After the rounds of being told I was &quot;in the clutches of the devil&quot; and &quot;going to die of AIDS&quot; (He is a <i>doctor</i>, he should know better!) I went back to school for a semester. And then, after not talking about it for a long time, he cuts off my education so I wouldn't be &quot;further corrupted by the liberals,&quot; or some crap like that. The idea was that he would force me to go to the local religious college. Oh, and such a lovely person, he made sure to cut off funding for my schooling <i>when the bill is in the mail</i>. I had a month or two as a person without credit, a job, and travelling to a unpaid dormitory to come up with thousands and thousands of tuition money.<br /> <br /> And he has the gall to tell me I need to apologize to <i>him</i> for &quot;breaking his heart.&quot; Gah.</div> </div> </div> </div>Dude, holy shit. I'm not gonna talk bad about your family because they're your family, but...holy shit, dude. Not okay.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-10T16:59:47-08:00","id":783762,"title":"","content":"I'm completely speechless. Hell.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i><b>I</b>'m <b>S</b>o <b>M</b>eta <b>E</b>ven <b>T</b>his <b>A</b>cronym</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/195-thorbes","name":"Thorbes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar195_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2982"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-11T03:15:48-08:00","id":784035,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JimB</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/58142-the-lgbt-thread?p=783705#post783705\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Dude, holy shit. I'm not gonna talk bad about your family because they're your family, but...holy shit, dude. Not okay.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> This, but also original Az words:<br /> <br /> Firstly, my condolences on having to deal with homophobic fuckery within a family setting. That just sucks and hurts your squishy human soul parts. I know. I've had to come out of the closet thrice, because my family has some easily agitated religious Alzheimer's type thinking that allows them to believe, again and again, that &quot;being a queer&quot; (actual quote. I identify as basically bi/pansexual, but whatever) is like having the flu, and that I'd gotten over it since they last checked.<br /> <br /> It's evolved into a strange, circular pattern that always involves my mom talking about wives I could hypothetically have (not single by choice, lady. Stop rubbing it in) accompanied by religious pamphlets being snuck to me by my grandmother in everything from books to holiday cards, like we're in a prison where Catholicism is a secret organization like a thieves' guild.<br /> <br /> My sister is bisexual, but they leave her alone because she moved the hell away and doesn't call them. That's my maternal family. I've never come out to my father. I honestly don't know what he'd say or do. It wouldn't be good, though. Once, after listening to a doctor (read: a motherfucking medical professional) explain, in detai for about an hour, that I had post-traumatic stress disorder and some other issues, he just shrugged and told the doctor &quot;I tell him to try harder to be better.&quot;<br /> <br /> Let that sink in.<br /> <br /> Explaining my sexuality to him would probably work about as smoothly as me telling him I'm an humanoid demon-mosquito who feeds on human blood and the tears of the innocent.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>\u201cNobody is purely good or purely evil. Mo</b></span><b>st of us are in-between. There are moths that explore the day and butterflies that play at night.\u201d </b><br /> - Suzy Kassem, Rise Up and Salute The Sun<br /> <b>(She/Her)</b></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","name":"AzraelFirestorm","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar380_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-11T04:35:33-08:00","id":784054,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dragonmystic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/58142-the-lgbt-thread?p=783616#post783616\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I never should have let them guilt me into going back.</div> </div> </div> </div>I won't go into the rest of what you wrote because I either lack the words or the ones I don't lack for, I wouldn't want to use in public.<br /> <br /> But yeah, you hit it on the head there. Don't let them guilt you into coming back when they make it clear that they don't really want you. Family obligation is a two-way-street, if they make no effort to make you feel at home with your family, you shouldn't feel like you have to bend over backwards to go back there.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2219-delta","name":"Delta","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"254"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-11T05:53:27-08:00","id":784092,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Delta</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/58142-the-lgbt-thread?p=784054#post784054\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">But yeah, you hit it on the head there. Don't let them guilt you into coming back when they make it clear that they don't really want you. Family obligation is a two-way-street, if they make no effort to make you feel at home with your family, you shouldn't feel like you have to bend over backwards to go back there.</div> </div> </div> </div>Not that you asked for my advice, Dragonmystic, but...yeah, I think Delta nailed it.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-11T06:20:19-08:00","id":784113,"title":"","content":"With dealing with shitty, selfish family members, I have learned one thing: The problem with unconditional love is that it is unconditional. My parents act more like they are my children then my parents. But though all the shit they put my sister and I though, I still love them. Sometimes I wish I didn't, but I do. So understand how family can guilt you into situations you rationally know better to avoid.<br /> <br /> I'm not saying that you should go. Actually, I suggest NOT going. However, you shouldn't beat yourself up over being guilted into doing things.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 12-11-2015, 09:34 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-11T06:23:57-08:00","id":784117,"title":"","content":"Mine life partner had <b><i>very</i> </b>tough time with his parents when they get to know we are together, 4 years ago. To say they treat him like Nazis the Jews is a bit understatement. When he run away after three days, I strongly stated he should not contact to them. When his own mother started to look for him and wanted to pay for private investigator, he agree to meet. Then, after this all shock and drama, they started to treat him normally as his own son.<br /> <br /> <b>ONLY after he left them and they understand what they done to him and how they treated him - and how mistake this was.</b><br /> <br /> Sometimes, conservatives need a shock to understand how hurtful they are to us.<br /> <br /> <b>Dragonmystic</b> - if your parents are guilty you to come back on Christmas to them, just answer that they hurt you lately and you do not come back. You need to learn live on your own, and <b><i>your parents clearly need a lesson about how to love and treat their child</i></b>. Be like beast, Dark Mother's Child, give them a lesson. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Let them think about their behaviors in all those Christmas. Maybe after them they will rethink their stand on you.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-11T06:43:27-08:00","id":784130,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AzraelFirestorm</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/58142-the-lgbt-thread?p=784035#post784035\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> This, but also original Az words:<br /> <br /> Firstly, my condolences on having to deal with homophobic fuckery within a family setting. That just sucks and hurts your squishy human soul parts. I know. I've had to come out of the closet thrice, because my family has some easily agitated religious Alzheimer's type thinking that allows them to believe, again and again, that &quot;being a queer&quot; (actual quote. I identify as basically bi/pansexual, but whatever) is like having the flu, and that I'd gotten over it since they last checked.<br /> <br /> It's evolved into a strange, circular pattern that always involves my mom talking about wives I could hypothetically have (not single by choice, lady. Stop rubbing it in) accompanied by religious pamphlets being snuck to me by my grandmother in everything from books to holiday cards, like we're in a prison where Catholicism is a secret organization like a thieves' guild.<br /> <br /> My sister is bisexual, but they leave her alone because she moved the hell away and doesn't call them. That's my maternal family. I've never come out to my father. I honestly don't know what he'd say or do. It wouldn't be good, though. Once, after listening to a doctor (read: a motherfucking medical professional) explain, in detai for about an hour, that I had post-traumatic stress disorder and some other issues, he just shrugged and told the doctor &quot;I tell him to try harder to be better.&quot;<br /> <br /> Let that sink in.<br /> <br /> Explaining my sexuality to him would probably work about as smoothly as me telling him I'm an humanoid demon-mosquito who feeds on human blood and the tears of the innocent.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Does it also come with weird powers like being some sort of humanoid demon-mosquito? I think bisexuality has invisibility as a innate power! Seriously though, yeah... I know those pains as well. Not exactly easy.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr />\u200bWhen noise turns to silence, when colors dull and pale, when reality no longer makes sense, there shall you find me. There, in the dreams of the River of Faceless Millions, do I dwell.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://harenm.deviantart.com/gallery/\" target=\"_blank\">http://harenm.deviantart.com/gallery/</a> for my art.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/378-haren","name":"haren","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar378_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"664"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-11T06:46:37-08:00","id":784134,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/58142-the-lgbt-thread?p=784117#post784117\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Mine life partner had <b><i>very</i> </b>tough time with his parents when they get to know we are together, 4 years ago. To say they treat him like Nazis the Jews is a bit understatement. When he run away after three days, I strongly stated he should not contact to them. When his own mother started to look for him and wanted to pay for private investigator, he agree to meet. Then, after this all shock and drama, they started to treat him normally as his own son.<br /> <br /> <b>ONLY after he left them and they understand what they done to him and how they treated him - and how mistake this was.</b><br /> <br /> Sometimes, conservatives need a shock to understand how hurtful they are to us.<br /> <br /> <b>Dragonmystic</b> - if your parents are guilty you to come back on Christmas to them, just answer that they hurt you lately and you do not come back. You need to learn live on your own, and <b><i>your parents clearly need a lesson about how to love and treat their child</i></b>. Be like beast, Dark Mother's Child, give them a lesson. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Let them think about their behaviors in all those Christmas. Maybe after them they will rethink their stand on you.</div> </div> </div> </div>Imagining Noriyuki Morita, doing Mr. Miyagi while reading wyrdhamster's post, has made my morning. I agree, by the way, but I'll just let my previous and slightly more thoughtful post stand as is.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>\u201cNobody is purely good or purely evil. Mo</b></span><b>st of us are in-between. There are moths that explore the day and butterflies that play at night.\u201d </b><br /> - Suzy Kassem, Rise Up and Salute The Sun<br /> <b>(She/Her)</b></span></span>","edited":{"userid":380,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","user":"AzraelFirestorm","date":".  comma 12-11-2015, 11:53 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","name":"AzraelFirestorm","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar380_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-11T08:17:50-08:00","id":784177,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dragonmystic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/58142-the-lgbt-thread?p=783616#post783616\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I have to get off my chest my frustrations and rant a bit, I hope that's okay.<br /> <br /> I am not looking forward to going to my parent's place for Christmas. I never should have let them guilt me into going back. I mean, I like some of my family, but even then the sheer religious culture of the place I grew up in is oppressive without any intentional malice, due to the doctrine on LGBT people. I don't think even the nice members of my family realize why I get uneasy when all they talk about is &quot;church activity this&quot; and &quot;church activity that.&quot; I don't like being reminded that my family believes in a religion that thinks I am somehow so flawed and....not worthy enough to be respected and treated like a person. Anytime I bring it up, they just get defensive and upset that I am &quot;attacking their religious beliefs.&quot;<br /> <br /> And then there's my dad. He....well. I told him I was gay. After the rounds of being told I was &quot;in the clutches of the devil&quot; and &quot;going to die of AIDS&quot; (He is a <i>doctor</i>, he should know better!) I went back to school for a semester. And then, after not talking about it for a long time, he cuts off my education so I wouldn't be &quot;further corrupted by the liberals,&quot; or some crap like that. The idea was that he would force me to go to the local religious college. Oh, and such a lovely person, he made sure to cut off funding for my schooling <i>when the bill is in the mail</i>. I had a month or two as a person without credit, a job, and travelling to a unpaid dormitory to come up with thousands and thousands of tuition money.<br /> <br /> And he has the gall to tell me I need to apologize to <i>him</i> for &quot;breaking his heart.&quot; Gah</div> </div> </div> </div>I am so sorry, Dragonmystic. It's a terrible thing when one is betrayed like that, especially by one's parents.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/707-etherial","name":"etherial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar707_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"822"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-11T08:18:52-08:00","id":784178,"title":"","content":"I appreciate the thoughts and words!<br /> <br /> I am going to go, but only for my siblings and mother. (And the cat. Oh Minou, you sneezy snot factory of a siamese, I miss you muchly.) That's more the way they guilted me into doing it, as I do like (most) of my siblings. &quot;Oh [X] really wants to see you!&quot; And they do, and are generally at least pleasant around me. Particularly my sister who *gasp* got a divorce, and so got to see some of the ugly sides of the culture too. At least there's some refuge there.<br /> <br /> It's really just my dad. My dad wanted to come to visit me, and I did blatantly tell him he wasn't welcome in my house. I feel proud for standing up to him like that. It's hard to stand up to someone that has taught you to be a floormat your entire life. He uses anything that he can to bully you into submission (emotionally), and then showers money on you when he feels guilty. I literally think he's bipolar, it would explain so many things. I don't like that I still...it disgusts me that I still want his approval.<br /> <br /> I um... I don't know where I was going with that. I think I just needed to get it off my chest. I am seeing a counselor, as many of you might be thinking right now. Don't want to turn this into a pity party fishing expedition....<br /> <br /> <br /> No, I think I'll leave this and post it. Can show somebody that is having conflicting opinions like this that they're not alone, things can be bad, but you're not alone and it does get better. You can have all this crap and still live and love and have a life outside of it.<br /> <br /> For example, just that feeling when (as a gay man,) you awake next to your lover. Watching his soft breathing as he sleeps, slowly waking up to look at you and a giant smile creeps onto his face to see you....yeah, it's all worth it. There may be some crap in the world, but in that moment, when you see that smile and love in the eyes of someone who accepts you for everything you are....yeah.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> P.S.<br /> <br /> I also have to mention a big part of my anxiety is the sheer <i>number</i> of people that are going to be there. Let's see, parents, 4 siblings, 3 niblings from one marriage, 5 niblings from the other pair, sister-in-Law, brother-in-law, Brother-in-law's family....oh gods there is easily going to be 20+ people coming in and out. I've live in a single bedroom apartment by myself. I just want to hide under my desk in anxiety already. ._.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/845-dragonmystic","name":"Dragonmystic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar845_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"586"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-11T08:47:00-08:00","id":784198,"title":"","content":"I'll just leave this here if anyone needs it.<br /> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"color:#404040\"><span style=\"font-family:Raleway\">Your Holiday Mom: <a href=\"http://www.yourholidaymom.com/\" target=\"_blank\">OFFERING OUR LGBTQ YOUTH A VIRTUAL HOME FOR THE HOLIDAYS</a></span></span></div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/707-etherial","name":"etherial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar707_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"822"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-11T11:32:42-08:00","id":784262,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dragonmystic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/58142-the-lgbt-thread?p=784178#post784178\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It's really just my dad. My dad wanted to come to visit me, and I did blatantly tell him he wasn't welcome in my house. I feel proud for standing up to him like that. It's hard to stand up to someone that has taught you to be a floormat your entire life. He uses anything that he can to bully you into submission (emotionally), and then showers money on you when he feels guilty. I literally think he's bipolar, it would explain so many things. <b>I don't like that I still...it disgusts me that I still want his approval.</b></div> </div> </div> </div>I felt for all of your post, but this part here... especially the part I bolded. It just... that's so much of how I feel about my father. I loathe him, his politics... his racism, sexism, and just generally looking down on everyone else... but there's still a part of me that wants the approval, and I hate myself a bit for it, because I don't know why...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr />\u200bWhen noise turns to silence, when colors dull and pale, when reality no longer makes sense, there shall you find me. There, in the dreams of the River of Faceless Millions, do I dwell.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://harenm.deviantart.com/gallery/\" target=\"_blank\">http://harenm.deviantart.com/gallery/</a> for my art.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/378-haren","name":"haren","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar378_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"664"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-11T11:50:27-08:00","id":784268,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>haren</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/58142-the-lgbt-thread?p=784262#post784262\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I felt for all of your post, but this part here... especially the part I bolded. It just... that's so much of how I feel about my father. I loathe him, his politics... his racism, sexism, and just generally looking down on everyone else... but there's still a part of me that wants the approval, and I hate myself a bit for it, because I don't know why...</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> It's natural, we can't blame ourselves for cultural and evolutionary programming. *nods*","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/845-dragonmystic","name":"Dragonmystic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar845_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"586"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-11T12:03:22-08:00","id":784276,"title":"","content":"Anyways, while there are these problems, it's wonderful having a community like this where it's cool if you're ok with not being the &quot;everygamer&quot; aka white cis hetero guy with some definite... exclusive tendancies. Note, I'm not saying all white cis hetero guys are that, just it's kinda the whole stereotype, but I think the community is far broader than that and the better for it. I'm glad that even those who aren't as much a minority respect other people more often than not around here. And this thread is a good example of it, I think. So I can take comfort in that.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr />\u200bWhen noise turns to silence, when colors dull and pale, when reality no longer makes sense, there shall you find me. There, in the dreams of the River of Faceless Millions, do I dwell.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://harenm.deviantart.com/gallery/\" target=\"_blank\">http://harenm.deviantart.com/gallery/</a> for my art.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/378-haren","name":"haren","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar378_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"664"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-11T12:42:31-08:00","id":784295,"title":"","content":"I'm white, cis gender...<br /> <br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://fbcdn-sphotos-h-a.akamaihd.net/hphotos-ak-xfl1/v/t1.0-9/310976_1815957973600_2114788400_n.jpg?oh=d7aeacd0d0c888c7c89644b67f9abf93&amp;oe=5720E564&amp;__gda__=1458245423_206a782eb46927a68f18fd6e4cf6a656\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> BUDDHA. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> And there is a Bisexual animal in me.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://fbcdn-sphotos-c-a.akamaihd.net/hphotos-ak-xap1/v/t1.0-9/298472_1815958133604_881355201_n.jpg?oh=e244743af1be6fd75510035161866b38&amp;oe=571F6494&amp;__gda__=1456926265_d38e53f03ffd253a43f5f34d3f163760\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> On more serious note - I'm very glad that 2ED nWoD is so sexuality progresive. Werewolves can change genders at will and Touchstones are described on example of one gay couple, mages can have diffrent gender Astral Body, in <b>Beast</b> there is Drug King character concept. Really, 2ED nWoD is one of most LGBT-friendly gamelines. <br /> <br /> And one last mem for other Bears, Cubs and Otters on this forums. <br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://fbcdn-sphotos-h-a.akamaihd.net/hphotos-ak-xft1/v/t1.0-9/11953038_10203801869922085_5969764061625632193_n.jpg?oh=e6944d2d863854b36af9a4d101e6942d&amp;oe=57152C7E&amp;__gda__=1461270668_c22b2922e9f6a5b62dae568fcd0cf9b9\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-11T12:48:44-08:00","id":784302,"title":"","content":"You have my sympathies, Dragonmystic. That really sucks. I am really sorry you have to deal with it. *hug* I know how the desire to please seems bred into the bone, and while things are not peachy with my parents I am perhaps fortunate things stand where they are. Remember we are here for you.<br /> <br /> It always doubly enrages me when a religion that focuses on love, acceptance, and giving is twisted into a religion of hate, and used as a weapon. I do not believe in Satan (or at least, the popular conception) but if I did, I would be certain they were laughing at how so many Christians have become vessels of hate, division, and cruelty, and are big part of what is wrong in the world. Not all, thank goodness, but too damn many. Sorry for the side rant, it just makes me mad.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Onyx Path Moderator </span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\">Forum Rules</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">This is my mod voice.</span> This is my goth voice.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/15731-geist-balance-of-shadows-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">[Geist: Balance of Shadows</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/17537-v20-the-conspiracy-of-hrad-%C4%8Dern%C3%A1-hora-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Vampire: The Conspiracy of Hrad \u010cern\u00e1 Hora</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/13838-scion-bohemian-front-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Scion: Bohemian Front</a>][<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/99033-changeling-malibu-dream-house-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling: Malibu Dream House</a>] [<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/268069-demon-night-train-detective-agency-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Demon: Night Train Detective Agency</a>] <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/la94fvk\" target=\"_blank\">[WoD: The Golden Eagle</a>]","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/56-baroness-nerak","name":"Baroness Nerak","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar56_2.jpeg","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2524"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-11T21:00:10-08:00","id":784524,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Baroness Nerak</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/58142-the-lgbt-thread?p=784302#post784302\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You have my sympathies, Dragonmystic. That really sucks. I am really sorry you have to deal with it. *hug* I know how the desire to please seems bred into the bone, and while things are not peachy with my parents I am perhaps fortunate things stand where they are. Remember we are here for you.<br /> <br /> It always doubly enrages me when a religion that focuses on love, acceptance, and giving is twisted into a religion of hate, and used as a weapon. I do not believe in Satan (or at least, the popular conception) but if I did, I would be certain they were laughing at how so many Christians have become vessels of hate, division, and cruelty, and are big part of what is wrong in the world. Not all, thank goodness, but too damn many. Sorry for the side rant, it just makes me mad.</div> </div> </div> </div>I support and agree with every single thing in this post. Even the asterisks.<br /> <br /> It's not fair to your thoughts, though, Baroness, to call that a side rant. That's my opinion, anyway. Anyone else agree? It's an issue that's been kicking LGBTQIA folks in their collective junk for fucking Ever. I think that makes it JUST as topically relevant to this thread as anything else we discuss. It HAS TO be more relevant than our recent page-long derail about our pets, at the very least.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>\u201cNobody is purely good or purely evil. Mo</b></span><b>st of us are in-between. There are moths that explore the day and butterflies that play at night.\u201d </b><br /> - Suzy Kassem, Rise Up and Salute The Sun<br /> <b>(She/Her)</b></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","name":"AzraelFirestorm","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar380_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-11T21:16:42-08:00","id":784527,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/845-dragonmystic\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar845_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"845\" data-vbnamecard=\"845\">Dragonmystic</a>, that sucks... a lot. I've had a family reunion due to my grand-father's death recently and... well let's just say they didn't choose a mental career. 20 loud, drunk people yelling how good the gin is and how good they can drive a snow-mobile for 6 hours got on my nerves <i>really quickly.</i> My solution to avoid the anxiety and the breakdown was to sneak away for a few minutes every now and then. Have a walk around the block, breathing exercises in a bedroom for a few minutes, go grab a coffee, anything that got me away really.<br /> <br /> And, well, it's the holiday season so I'll have a few more meetings with them, but hey I'll manage (probably).<br /> <br /> If you (or anyone, really) ever get around Quebec, leave me a PM I can usually manage some time within 24h for a coffee or a boardgame or some weird RPG one-shots. I can also offer a couch to crash on <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Anyway, to all those with a rough holiday season ahead: keep your smile up, you've got friends waiting for you, and just remember to take a deep breath once in a while.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Glorious Useless-Post Prana<br /> <span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Cost: 2</span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">m; </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Mins: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Linguistics 1, Essence 1 </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Type: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2