bcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wbj.pl</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\"><span style=\"color:#535353\"><span style=\"font-family:Open Sans\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">\u201cFree interpretation of the verdict says that the court </span></span></span><span style=\"color:#535353\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\">recognized same-sex couples as a family,\u201d said Miros\u0142awa Makuchowska from NGO Campaign against Homophobia (Kampania Przeciw Homofobii \u2013 KPH).</span></span> <span style=\"color:#535353\"><span style=\"font-family:Open Sans\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">The Supreme Court settled a question of the first <span style=\"font-family:inherit\">president of the Supreme Court Ma\u0142gorzata Gersdorf, who wanted to remove ambiguities arising from the decisions of the courts concerning the right to refuse to testify against the accused person in cases when it comes to same-sex partners.</span></span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#535353\"><span style=\"font-family:Open Sans\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\">\u201cThe system of legal protection cannot be differentiated with respect to gender,\u201d said Supreme Court\u2019s justice Jaros\u0142aw Matras.</span></span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#535353\"><span style=\"font-family:Open Sans\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\">According to the Criminal Code, a person closest to the accused may refuse to testify and is entitled to other powers, for example they may exercise the rights of the deceased. Under the Penal Code \u201ca spouse, an ascendant, a descendant, a sibling, a relative in the same line or degree, an adopted person and his spouse, as well as people cohabiting\u201d are considered to be the closest person.</span></span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#535353\"><span style=\"font-family:Open Sans\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\">\u201cUntil now same-sex couples were regarded by the law as strangers,\u201d Makuchowska commented.</span></span></span></span></div> </div> </div> </div><span style=\"color:#535353\"><span style=\"font-family:Open Sans\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br /> </span></span></span><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-26T17:24:01-08:00","id":837819,"title":"","content":"How annoying that the LGBT community of Poland has to go through that in this age. Hearing this news I guess is a good start. I wish the LGBT community of Poland luck and love through this process. Stay strong dude! You can do this!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2360-cecoyotl","name":"Cecoyotl","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2360_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"207"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-26T21:17:33-08:00","id":837919,"title":"","content":"To be true, mem was ironic - why it's Frustrated Farnsworth based. Ruling is almost nothing really changing and we are still YEARS before Civil Unions. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> I still need to prove in court that my partner of 5 years IS my life partner - especially as we do not have one account and different (official) places of residence. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/confused.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Confused\" smilieid=\"10\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <b>Supreme Court ruling only stated typical practice of judges, and it's STILL only more a hint than rule</b> as we do not have precedence law. Or at least my cousin that is lawyer described it to me. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> I'm surely more glad than worried with that ruling now - but it's still only &quot;fig leaf&quot; on the problem of LGBT people discrimination.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 02-27-2016, 07:11 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-09T09:49:51-08:00","id":844564,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"http://www.windycitymediagroup.com/lgbt/Second-Wachowski-filmmaker-sibling-comes-out-as-trans-/54509.html\" target=\"_blank\"><b><i>Breaking News: Second Wachowski filmmaker sibling comes out as trans!</i></b></a><br /> <br /> Previously known as Andy, the now Lily join to her sister Lana as queer person. Wife and coworkers support her transition for years. Coming Out was forced because UK tabloid <i>Daily Mail </i>journalist was on track of her and almost made press outing,<br /> <br /> Lily wrote moving letter concerning trans people suicides and murders rates with her thoughts on non-binary gender identities. I highly recommend reading of it!","signature":"","edited":{"useri