ll you find me. There, in the dreams of the River of Faceless Millions, do I dwell.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://harenm.deviantart.com/gallery/\" target=\"_blank\">http://harenm.deviantart.com/gallery/</a> for my art.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/378-haren","name":"haren","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar378_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"664"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-22T06:44:38-07:00","id":851109,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>haren</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/58142-the-lgbt-thread?p=850642#post850642\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Oh, has anyone here ever watched the web series Carmilla?</div> </div> </div> </div>Can't say I did.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> So...last week was strange. I witnessed casual homophobia at the school I'm working in, not from the kids, but from my colleagues. They freaked out because two boys from fourth grade are used to hold hands and sometimes kiss. And when we talked about it with my co-workers, the kids were called &quot;kind of freaks&quot;.<br /> Here's also how some reacted : <br /> &quot;Oh man, what if some other kids want to imitate them?&quot;<br /> &quot;What if they tell the parents they saw two boys kissing?&quot;<br /> &quot;I mean, if it was a boy and a girl, it would be fine, but this...&quot;<br /> <br /> And in other news... I came out to my dad as well. And it did not go well. To be honest,