ink":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/378-haren","name":"haren","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar378_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"664"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-22T15:06:46-07:00","id":851378,"title":"","content":"Not seen 0 yet.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Onyx Path Moderator </span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\">Forum Rules</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">This is my mod voice.</span> This is my goth voice.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/15731-geist-balance-of-shadows-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">[Geist: Balance of Shadows</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/17537-v20-the-conspiracy-of-hrad-%C4%8Dern%C3%A1-hora-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Vampire: The Conspiracy of Hrad \u010cern\u00e1 Hora</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/13838-scion-bohemian-front-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Scion: Bohemian Front</a>][<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/99033-changeling-malibu-dream-house-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling: Malibu Dream House</a>] [<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/268069-demon-night-train-detective-agency-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Demon: Night Train Detective Agency</a>] <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/la94fvk\" target=\"_blank\">[WoD: The Golden Eagle</a>]","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/56-baroness-nerak","name":"Baroness Nerak","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar56_2.jpeg","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2524"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-22T17:08:42-07:00","id":851457,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Evilmarmelade</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/58142-the-lgbt-thread?p=851109#post851109\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So...last week was strange. I witnessed casual homophobia at the school I'm working in, not from the kids, but from my colleagues. They freaked out because two boys from fourth grade are used to hold hands and sometimes kiss. And when we talked about it with my co-workers, the kids were called &quot;kind of freaks&quot;.<br /> Here's also how some reacted :<br /> &quot;Oh man, what if some other kids want to imitate them?&quot;<br /> &quot;What if they tell the parents they saw two boys kissing?&quot;<br /> &quot;I mean, if it was a boy and a girl, it would be fine, but this...&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>Good Lord. If I may ask, where do you work (country/state)? -- that is some pretty narrow-mindedness on their parts, as a group of educators. (It'd be one thing if you said it had been just one or two teachers -- there are always at least *some* in almost every school -- but for there to be several or more, it allows one to infer that you must work at a school that is in a conservative state -- if in the U.S. -- or in a conservative part of your country if elsewhere.) That is truly disheartening to read about.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Evilmarmelade</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/58142-the-lgbt-thread?p=851109#post851109\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And in other news... I came out to my dad as well. And it did not go well. To be honest, i was forced to, he confronted me about it... because he had searched my phone and found my gay dating apps. He called this a disappointment... I guess I feel betrayed, but I'm super pissed at him, and to hell with him if he doesn't accept it.</div> </div> </div> </div>Judging from the context of this part of your post, I was initially assuming you were a teacher or whatnot given the previous paragraph; are you, yourself, a student and/or living at home? Why did your dad go through your phone? That's rude on multiple levels. As for the more obvious issue of his being &quot;disappointed&quot; in you, I can only offer sympathy and hope that you find a better standing with him (if that is what you desire) or otherwise come to terms with his not being a part of your life (again, if that is what you desire) due to his intolerance and/or bigotry (particularly towards his own child). Sorry, dude...<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I have been around here for waaaayyyy too fucking long...","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1433-just-john-forever","name":"Just John, Forever...","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-22T17:58:31-07:00","id":851480,"title":"","content":"I live in France, actually. My town, Aix-en-Provence, is rather fancy, and the school i'm working in is a nice residential district. Not quite upper class, but definitely middle-class at worst.<br /> I am not a teacher, I am actually a social worker, employed by the city to help during recess to watch over the kids, and to also supervise extracurricular group activities. And the colleagues in question aren't teachers as well, but they have posts very similar to mine. They aren't openly hostile to it, and they say they have no problems with gay people, but... it's just casual homophobia. They don't realize how hurtful they sound.<br /> <br /> And no, I don't live with my parents anymore, my dad searched through my phone while I was visiting him over the weekend. Perhaps he saw a notification, and looked at it..; I don't know, and i don't really care. It hurts because I wasn't looking for approbation, but for support, since my morale isn't exactly shining right now... And I didn't get any. Screw him.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;And for my next trick&quot; I said, &quot;anvils!&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2016-evilmarmelade","name":"Evilmarmelade","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2016_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"632"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-22T19:45:50-07:00","id":851536,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"q