y aren't openly hostile to it, and they say they have no problems with gay people, but... it's just casual homophobia. They don't realize how hurtful they sound.<br /> <br /> And no, I don't live with my parents anymore, my dad searched through my phone while I was visiting him over the weekend. Perhaps he saw a notification, and looked at it..; I don't know, and i don't really care. It hurts because I wasn't looking for approbation, but for support, since my morale isn't exactly shining right now... And I didn't get any. Screw him.</div> </div> </div> </div>Gotcha. In any case, sorry to read that! Hope things resolve themselves better in the future...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I have been around here for waaaayyyy too fucking long...","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1433-just-john-forever","name":"Just John, Forever...","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-23T21:30:14-07:00","id":852236,"title":"","content":"And North Carolina just became Homophobia/Transphobia central.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Onyx Path Moderator </span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\">Forum Rules</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">This is my mod voice.</span> This is my goth voice.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/15731-geist-balance-of-shadows-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">[Geist: Balance of Shadows</a><a href=\"