/><br/><div align=\"center\">Wow I wish I had something cool to say here</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2227-dman1123","name":"dman1123","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2227_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"135"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-25T20:20:17-07:00","id":853302,"title":"","content":"I had a friend who taught physics at the... university there? I know she lived in Flint at the time... I also know Michigan is NOT a very trans friendly place. And I grew up and lived most of my life in North Dakota... so I get your feelings there.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr />\u200bWhen noise turns to silence, when colors dull and pale, when reality no longer makes sense, there shall you find me. There, in the dreams of the River of Faceless Millions, do I dwell.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://harenm.deviantart.com/gallery/\" target=\"_blank\">http://harenm.deviantart.com/gallery/</a> for my art.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/378-haren","name":"haren","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar378_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"664"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-25T20:56:30-07:00","id":853309,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>dman1123</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/58142-the-lgbt-thread?p=853249#post853249\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Well, provided they get a federal judge that believes in the law and not religious doctrine. Because there have been several times in recent history that federal judges have upheld an unfair law until the national Supreme Court overturned the state supreme court's decision.</div> </div> </div> </div>Sorry to jump in, but I've been having this argument with a friend of mine.<br /> <br /> There's almost certainly a degree of religious bigotry in the bathroom bills - but they're also reflecting a very real concern. There are a lot of freaks out there . . . and not the good kind. Bastards who can and will exploit the loophole of a trans-friendly bathroom, in order to prey on women and children.<br /> <br /> I used to be a librarian, and you'd be shocked at what some people think they can get away with. In our bathrooms, I ran into everything from drug deals through arson. And that's not counting weirdness like the naked guy who barricaded himself in the men's room, and started cutting &quot;authentic&quot; runes into his skin (man, that was a mess to clean up).<br /> <br /> So - speaking from experience - you need to be able to throw a(n apparent) man out of the women's restroom. There are just too many predators and lunatics out there, who wouldn't hesitate to scream &quot;discrimination&quot; in order to get closer to their prey.<br /> <br /> I don't want to have to chose between two &quot;at-risk&quot; groups, such as transgendered individuals, and little girls. But if a choice has to be made, I'm sorry, but you have to go with the little girls. Adults protect children. You don't put children at risk to protect adults.<br /> <br /> Now, if you want to look at adding a third, non-gender specific bathroom facility, that's fine. And there are probably other solutions worth exploring. But letting men use the women's restroom is going to get women and children hurt. That's why they've been a deal-breaker since Houston","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4624-one-vorlon","name":"One Vorlon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"537"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-25T21:32:39-07:00","id":853322,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>One Vorlon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/58142-the-lgbt-thread?p=853309#post853309\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">letting men use the women's restroom is going to get women and children hurt.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ok, here's the thing. This is not about letting men use the women's restroom. This is about letting women use the women's restroom.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-25T22:17:23-07:00","id":853340,"title":"","content":"As Charlaquin said, this is about women doing it.<br /> <br /> For the record, if someone is going to rape women or children...the relatively minor crime of entering a women's bathroom to do it is not significant. The law does not make an impassable shield. It just means a comparatively minor law must be broken to break the major law they are going to break anyway. And they could claim to the a Trans Man and get in now.<br /> <br /> If someone is worried about women being raped, how about Trans women in men's rooms? It is not necessarily safe for an attractive femininely dressed gal in these, whether she passes or not.<br /> <br /> Trans women and little girls is a false dichotomy. Someone who wants to go into the ladies room to hurt a little girl, will. Trans women won't suddenly find themselves in mens room without being forced there.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Onyx Path Moderator </span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\">Forum Rules</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">This is my mod voice.</span> This is my goth voice.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/15731-geist-balance-of-shadows-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">[Geist: Balance of Shadows</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/17537-v20-the-conspiracy-of-hrad-%C4%8Dern%C3%A1-hora-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Vampire: The Conspiracy of Hrad \u010cern\u00e1 Hora</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/13838-scion-bohemian-front-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Scion: Bohemian Front</a>][<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/99033-changeling-malibu-dream-house-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling: Malibu Dream House</a>] [<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/268069-demon-night-train-detective-agency-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Demon: Night Train Detective Agency</a>] <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/la94fvk\" target=\"_blank\">[WoD: The Golden Eagle</a>]","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/56-baroness-nerak","name":"Baroness Nerak","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar56_2.jpeg","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2524"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-25T23:51:26-07:00","id":853362,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>One Vorlon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/58142-the-lgbt-thread?p=853309#post853309\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Sorry to jump in, but I've been having this argument with a friend of mine.<br /> <br /> There's almost certainly a degree of religious bigotry in the bathroom bills - but they're also reflecting a very real concern. There are a lot of freaks out there . . . and not the good kind. Bastards who can and will exploit the loophole of a trans-friendly bathroom, in order to prey on women and children.<br /> <br /> I used to be a librarian, and you'd be shocked at what some people think they can get away with. In our bathrooms, I ran into everything from drug deals through arson. And that's not counting weirdness like the naked guy who barricaded himself in the men's room, and started cutting &quot;authentic&quot; runes into his skin (man, that was a mess to clean up).<br /> <br /> So - speaking from experience - you need to be able to throw a(n apparent) man out of the women's restroom. There are just too many predators and lunatics out there, who wouldn't hesitate to scream &quot;discrimination&quot; in order to get closer to their prey.<br /> <br /> I don't want to have to chose between two &quot;at-risk&quot; groups, such as transgendered individuals, and little girls. But if a choice has to be made, I'm sorry, but you have to go with the little girls. Adults protect children. You don't put children at risk to protect adults.<br /> <br /> Now, if you want to look at adding a third, non-gender specific bathroom facility, that's fine. And there are probably other solutions worth exploring. But letting men use the women's restroom is going to get women and children hurt. That's why they've been a deal-breaker since Houston</div> </div> </div> </div>I'll echo the other mods. This is a false threat.<br /> <br /> Indeed, if we go by those standards why let men and women <b>ever</b> be in the same room together? I mean, its not like people are only vulnerable in the bathroom. Sure, one could make a literal 'caught with your pants down' jab, but really if someone twice your body mass jumps you alone in a secluded space the state of your pants, literal or metaphorical, is not going to matter very much.<br /> <br /> And just look at the examples you gave! Drug deals? Arson? Bizarre occult self-injury? Do you really need a 'gotcha' to kick these people out of the bathroom?<br /> <br /> Creepers are gonna creep. Frankly I think the risk of a fit, six foot tall trans woman strolling in and beating the ever loving shit out of them will do more to deter perverts than a silhouette ever will.<br /> <br /> <b>Edit: </b>I should be loath to not also touch on the whole &quot;protect the children!&quot; angle, which is always a reliable rallying cry. The argument is that we should choose &quot;little girls&quot; over transwomen, but what about young boys? If there's one thing our pedophobic media machine has taught me it's that these super predators have no regard for gender. In this scenario little boys will still be stuck in the men's bathroom with these dangerous predators!<br /> <br /> But you know the funny thing? I'm not hearing anyone calling for children-only bathrooms, or seeing any breaking reports about the &quot;bathroom pedophilia epidemic&quot; that is ravaging America. So I call fie on this reasoning. At least until I'm provided with some compelling, peer reviewed statistics demonstrating that children really are at risk in bathrooms. And even then the solution is not &quot;ban the trans&quot; it's &quot;don't let your fucking kids go alone into secluded bathrooms&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>Edit x2: </b><a href=\"http://www.yellodyno.com/html/child_molester_stats.html\" target=\"_blank\">Have some statistics.</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Onyx Path Moderator </span><br /> <b>Mod Voice is <u><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">RED</span></u>*</b><br /> <i>*All other colors should be read aloud in the voice of Don Knotts</i><b>.</b> <hr /><b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/18519-pendragon-s-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\">Hacks and House Rules Hub Thread</a></b><br /> <br /> <b>CofD Hacks By Splat: <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13vBLaS5Ua1Ez-cVyK6uFa4ssvYeIIZpoA5GQTXytfcA/edit\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Vampire</span></a> | <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1sqltG7X-C_MdEe00